audit.append('## Record562\nActual pages1030–firstlines1033; Russian1030–32 and scans1030–32 read. Independent checks: Lorentzian sign, constraint sum, Fourier delta, zero modes, all-Virasoro annihilation contradiction. Opened primary PDFs: Dirac1950(Cambridge sections2–4), Tong0908.0333(section2.1), Bahns hep-th/0403108(sections2,4–5), Bahns–Meinecke1103.0974(section1,Proposition15,p20), Enriquez–Halbout0804.0496(Theorem1.1). Pohlmeyer–Rehren1988 publisher abstract/chronology opened; original full proof inaccessible. Pohlmeyer1982 publisher was blocked; no full-result verification claimed. IDs .7 classical,.8 canonical failure,.9 GP-1982-01 deformation,.10 completeness fixed. Quantization existence rules out a manufactured classC. Earlier index has no exact cyclic-charge problem.')
